      <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.4;">The first layer is</h3>
      <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">a layer of lamination made of bubble wrap. Bubble wrap is an essential component of any packaging solution due to its shock-absorbing capabilities. It provides a cushioning effect that helps absorb any sudden impacts or vibrations encountered during transit. This layer is crucial for protecting fragile household items such as crockery, glassware, and decorative items. It also prevents any scratches or cracks that may occur due to collisions between these items during transit.</p>
