      <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.4;">The second layer is</h3>
      <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">a corrugated cardboard sheet. Corrugated cardboard is a robust and lightweight material that offers excellent strength and durability. The corrugated sheet is placed between the bubble wrap layers to provide an additional layer of protection. It acts as a barrier between the bubble wrap layers, preventing direct contact between the delicate items and the bubble wraps, thus reducing the risk of damage. This layer also helps absorb some of the impact, further reducing the chances of breakage.</p>
