<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Ahmedabad To Bangalore Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors determine the cost of shifting a 1 BHK from Ahmedabad to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost of moving a 1 BHK between Ahmedabad and Bangalore depends on the total volume of goods, distance‑based freight rates, type of packing material selected, insurance coverage, fuel surcharge, and any additional services such as disassembly or temporary storage. Seasonal demand and exact pickup‑drop locations can also influence the final quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure the safety of fragile items during the Ahmedabad to Bangalore transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad employs a 7‑layer protective packaging system that combines high‑density bubble wrap, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, foam edge protectors, and weather‑proof stretch film. Each fragile item is individually crated, secured with ratchet lashings, and loaded onto specialized container trucks equipped with vibration‑dampening suspension, guaranteeing safe transit across the 1,608 km corridor.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there extra charges for car transport services when moving from Ahmedabad to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Car transport services are priced separately from household relocation. Charges are based on vehicle size, weight, required loading equipment (hydraulic ramps or carrier platforms), insurance premium, and any special handling for luxury or vintage cars. While the base freight covers the route, fuel surcharges and tolls are added transparently to the final invoice.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for an intercity move on the Ahmedabad‑Bangalore route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Customers must provide a valid government‑issued ID, GST registration (if applicable), a signed packing list, and a copy of the e‑Way bill generated for the shipment. For vehicle transport, registration certificate, insurance policy, and a No‑Objection Certificate (NOC) from the bank (if financed) are also required. Shree Ashirwad assists in preparing all paperwork.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does an Ahmedabad to Bangalore relocation typically take and what can affect the timeline?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A standard household move between Ahmedabad and Bangalore usually completes within 4‑5 business days, including loading, transit, and unloading. Factors that can extend the timeline are heavy traffic at major check‑posts, adverse weather, additional customs or toll clearances, and any last‑minute changes to pickup or delivery addresses.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time during the Ahmedabad‑Bangalore move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every container truck is equipped with a satellite‑enabled GPS unit that feeds live location data to Shree Ashirwad’s customer portal. Users receive instant alerts for departure, checkpoint clearances, and arrival, allowing full visibility of the shipment throughout the 1,608 km journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is provided for goods during the Ahmedabad to Bangalore relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All shipments are covered by a 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. This policy protects against loss, theft, or damage from the moment goods are packed until they are safely delivered at the destination. Customers can also opt for higher coverage limits for high‑value items such as electronics or artwork.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
